  "The share of Luxembourg's imports that were lifting and handling machinery increased from 0.1% in 2005 to 3.1% in 2025.",
  "The median share over the period 2005 to 2025 was 0.2%.",
  "The largest change between consecutive years occurred between 2024 and 2025, when the share jumped from 0.3% to 3.1%.",
